  "bio": "Petra Gribi is an exceptional tattoo artist based in Lenzburg, Switzerland, renowned for her distinct sketch style tattoos. Her professionalism is evident in every aspect of her work, from the initial design consultation to the final touch on your new art piece. Petra ensures a superior experience for all her clients, with a focus on quality and meticulous details that truly bring her sketches to life.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Lenzburg, Aargau, Switzerland\n\n♥︎ TᗩTTOO \n♥ TᗩTTOOᗩᖇTIᔕT \n♥︎ ᑭᗩIᑎTIᑎᘜ \nꕥ 𝙱𝚊𝚑𝚗𝚑𝚘𝚏𝚜𝚝𝚛𝚊𝚜𝚜𝚎 𝟼𝟼\n𝟻𝟼𝟶𝟻 𝙳𝚘𝚝𝚝𝚒𝚔𝚘𝚗, 𝚂𝚠𝚒𝚝𝚣𝚎𝚛𝚕𝚊𝚗𝚍 ꕥ",
